{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>汪明荃（Liza姐）與羅家英相愛多年，感情深厚，一向是演藝圈的模範夫妻。適逢家英哥迎來80歲大壽，阿姐特意舉辦了一場場面溫馨且熱鬧的壽宴，邀請眾多親朋好友與同門齊聚一堂慶祝，阿姐亦於社交平台曬出多張慶生照，並發文祝賀：「羅家英80大壽。恭喜你身體健康、開心長壽！」</p><figure><img alt=\"模範夫妻！（IG@wang_liza）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185205380033024000742389.jpeg/MSHYZBQqRU92NuUSEwKNKAcxZclrTlyjS4GGXEuBhlw\"/><figcaption>模範夫妻！（IG@wang_liza）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"拍拖睇演唱會。（IG@wang_liza）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185205382679760896617230.jpeg/GxM6FIx2TS-0vsciDxkJ9eUAa-W37D3lQeSrQUHkq0E\"/><figcaption>拍拖睇演唱會。（IG@wang_liza）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慶祝生日。（IG@wang_liza）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185205279755603968163498.jpeg/O6El32iTgtZs9aEGgys5fOCDBbHwf7TnjagTrY2oE60\"/><figcaption>慶祝生日。（IG@wang_liza）</figcaption></figure><p>羅家英喜迎80歲大壽擺壽宴　與汪明荃拖手切壽桃蛋糕</p><p>從阿姐分享的壽宴現場相片可見，家英哥身穿深色西裝襯紅色頸巾，精神奕奕，而阿姐身穿彩色幾何圖案長外套配搭運動鞋，貴氣又不失時尚活力。宴會現場特別準備了精緻的雙層粉色壽桃蛋糕，上面寫有「家英哥 福如東海 健康開心」及代表80歲的金色字樣。阿姐與家英哥甜蜜合照，場面溫馨。</p><figure><img alt=\"羅家英80歲大壽！（IG@wang_liza）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185203935745937408658702.jpeg/75WXzG5ZC0oTqCl82yHWdbrES1wxpJIlVOKvxFTir8Q\"/><figcaption>羅家英80歲大壽！（IG@wang_liza）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"羅家英80歲大壽！（IG@wang_liza）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185204242357424128769810.jpeg/PiLfX6P_CYJwiqrJHuPbRX5xyekxToPiaL2x-Wi9sfk\"/><figcaption>羅家英80歲大壽！（IG@wang_liza）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"恩愛！（IG@wang_liza）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185203930007867392480215.jpeg/-cmZyJsFHJl9v55KXFFk-3T_eLkjC02zax1OMWsdTjE\"/><figcaption>恩愛！（IG@wang_liza）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"場面熱鬧！（IG@wang_liza）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185203927386296320184579.jpeg/4DYMmWwqDOCcM3kcJyDqupyZU83H3DJMxpyIMsaciDI\"/><figcaption>場面熱鬧！（IG@wang_liza）</figcaption></figure><p>親朋好友齊聚場面熱鬧　後輩雙膝跪地奉茶</p><p>今次壽宴安排在酒樓進行，筵開多席，場面熱鬧。除了與一眾親友大合照、舉杯暢飲外，身為粵劇界名宿的家英哥，更獲後輩雙膝跪地敬茶，不少圈中後輩及網民亦紛紛留言送上祝福，祝願家英哥福如東海、壽比南山，與阿姐繼續恩愛甜蜜！</p><figure><img alt=\"場面熱鬧！（IG@wang_liza）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185203922931814400783025.jpeg/vGV7xsPWvCXtbI5pUBcod63HhSch5duMmQuuRpkLrkY\"/><figcaption>場面熱鬧！（IG@wang_liza）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"獲後輩雙膝跪地奉茶祝賀。（IG@wang_liza）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261009/1185203933069840384938461.jpeg/NM_Ufg8Tl4dIyCFAiBoACG2x5QfAgljbBcy-3wXMvt8\"/><figcaption>獲後輩雙膝跪地奉茶祝賀。（IG@wang_liza）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T07:19:56.234528+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":614,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}